WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.900
«I'm embarrassed to write to people who know me.

2
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.650
I'm afraid of bothering them.»

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.700
Open your contacts. You see the names of people who've known you for twenty years.

4
00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:13.840
And you freeze. But you're not embarrassed of the person.

5
00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:15.630
You're embarrassed of the message.

6
00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:20.590
With RelAI the first message stays on the person, not on the offer.

7
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.230
One real fact. One question only.

8
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:27.610
And no apologies: it never writes «sorry to bother you».

9
00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:31.500
Remove the wrong message, and the embarrassment disappears.
